{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 01 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">CNN 主干：从大规模分类到现代卷积</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CNN Backbones</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_001_alexnet-title\">AlexNet</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以 GPU、ReLU、dropout 和深卷积组合首次规模化训练 ImageNet 级深 CNN。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">First large-scale ImageNet-grade deep CNN trained end-to-end by combining dual-GPU parallelism, non-saturating ReLU activations, dropout regularization, and stacked convolutions.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">224×224 RGB 图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">224×224 RGB image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">类别概率或倒数第二层视觉特征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Closed-set class probabilities or penultimate 4096-D visual feature vector</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.5</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2012/hash/c399862d3b9d6b76c8436e924a68c45b-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_001_alexnet')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_001_alexnet')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"AlexNet original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/cad8c890b94f8080f8f7.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.5</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_001_alexnet', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_001_alexnet\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_001_alexnet')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_001_alexnet', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_001_alexnet\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">RGB 图像经随机裁剪、翻转与均值处理进入网络。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">RGB image enters the network after random cropping, horizontal flipping, and mean subtraction.</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"RGB 图像经随机裁剪、翻转与均值处理进入网络。\" data-node-desc-en=\"RGB image enters the network after random cropping, horizontal flipping, and mean subtraction.\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_001_alexnet', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">RGB 图像经随机裁剪、翻转与均值处理进入网络。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">RGB image enters the network after random cropping, horizontal flipping, and mean subtraction.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"大步幅卷积快速降采样，ReLU 取代易饱和激活。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Large-stride convolution rapidly downsamples spatial resolution while ReLU replaces saturating activations.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"11×11 Conv\" data-node-name-en=\"11×11 Conv\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_001_alexnet', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>11×11 Conv</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">大步幅卷积快速降采样，ReLU 取代易饱和激活。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Large-stride convolution rapidly downsamples spatial resolution while ReLU replaces saturating activations.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"重叠最大池化压缩空间；原版使用局部响应归一化。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Overlapping max-pooling compresses spatial dimensions; original formulation applies Local Response Normalization (LRN).\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Pool + LRN\" data-node-name-en=\"Pool + LRN\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_001_alexnet', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Pool + LRN</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">重叠最大池化压缩空间；原版使用局部响应归一化。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Overlapping max-pooling compresses spatial dimensions; original formulation applies Local Response Normalization (LRN).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"原始双 GPU 实现按通道分组计算第二层卷积。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Original dual-GPU implementation partitions channels into two parallel groups for second-layer convolution.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"5×5 分组卷积\" data-node-name-en=\"5×5 Grouped Conv\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_001_alexnet', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">5×5 分组卷积</span><span class=\"lang-en\">5×5 Grouped Conv</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">原始双 GPU 实现按通道分组计算第二层卷积。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Original dual-GPU implementation partitions channels into two parallel groups for second-layer convolution.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"连续三层卷积组合中层纹理与高层形状证据。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Three consecutive 3×3 convolutional layers compose mid-level textures and high-level shape cues.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"3×3 Conv 堆叠\" data-node-name-en=\"Stacked 3×3 Convs\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_001_alexnet', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">3×3 Conv 堆叠</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stacked 3×3 Convs</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">连续三层卷积组合中层纹理与高层形状证据。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Three consecutive 3×3 convolutional layers compose mid-level textures and high-level shape cues.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"两层大容量全连接层，训练时以 dropout 抑制共适应。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Two high-capacity fully connected layers regularized via dropout during training to suppress co-adaptation.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"FC6–FC7\" data-node-name-en=\"FC6–FC7\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_001_alexnet', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>FC6–FC7</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">两层大容量全连接层，训练时以 dropout 抑制共适应。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Two high-capacity fully connected layers regularized via dropout during training to suppress co-adaptation.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"线性层把高维特征映射到固定类别 logits。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Linear classifier projects high-dimensional features onto closed-set class logits.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"分类头\" data-node-name-en=\"Classification Head\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_001_alexnet', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">分类头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Classification Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">线性层把高维特征映射到固定类别 logits。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Linear classifier projects high-dimensional features onto closed-set class logits.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将 logits 归一化为封闭类别概率。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Normalizes raw logits into closed-set categorical probabilities via Softmax.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Softmax\" data-node-name-en=\"Softmax\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_001_alexnet', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Softmax</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将 logits 归一化为封闭类别概率。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Normalizes raw logits into closed-set categorical probabilities via Softmax.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"AlexNet Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 原始 AlexNet 的跨通道局部响应归一化</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Cross-Channel Local Response Normalization (LRN) in Original AlexNet</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"AlexNet：核心公式 · 原始 AlexNet 的跨通道局部响应归一化\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"1\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"36.688267pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.543823 -69.004338 175.036479 36.688267\" width=\"175.036479pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.7245-.992542L4.605395-1.091796L4.327483-.813884C4.019795-.496271 3.90069-.406942 3.811361-.406942C3.731958-.406942 3.672405-.466495 3.672405-.535973C3.672405-.734481 4.089273-2.441653 4.555768-4.1389C4.585544-4.238154 4.595469-4.258005 4.61532-4.347334L4.545842-4.37711L3.940392-4.307632L3.910615-4.277856L3.801436-3.801436C3.722032-4.168676 3.434195-4.37711 3.007402-4.37711C1.687321-4.37711 .168732-2.570684 .168732-.992542C.168732-.297763 .545898 .10918 1.181125 .10918C1.875904 .10918 2.302697-.218359 3.176134-1.449111C2.967701-.635227 2.94785-.555824 2.94785-.307688C2.94785-.019851 3.066955 .099254 3.344866 .099254C3.741883 .099254 3.980093-.089329 4.7245-.992542ZM3.622778-3.5533C3.622778-2.719565 3.116582-1.548365 2.441653-.813884C2.203443-.545898 1.865979-.377166 1.578142-.37716