x=\"43.53056\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g10-184\" y=\"-59.859724\"></use><use x=\"48.301472\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g16-61\" y=\"-59.859724\"></use><use x=\"52.497828\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g10-157\" y=\"-59.859724\"></use><use x=\"55.843284\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g23-50\" y=\"-59.859724\"></use><use x=\"59.843287\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g10-186\" y=\"-59.859724\"></use><use x=\"28.865726\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g7-213\" y=\"-57.324781\"></use><use x=\"10.061513\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g16-57\" y=\"-35.247856\"></use><use x=\"12.817873\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g1-61\" y=\"-35.247856\"></use><use x=\"17.443327\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g23-109\" y=\"-35.247856\"></use><use x=\"23.101511\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g23-97\" y=\"-35.247856\"></use><use x=\"26.330605\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g23-120\" y=\"-35.247856\"></use><use x=\"30.548769\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g10-185\" y=\"-35.247856\"></use><use x=\"33.334216\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g23-48\" y=\"-35.247856\"></use><use x=\"37.116039\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g16-150\" y=\"-35.247856\"></use><use x=\"39.42149\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g16-56\" y=\"-35.247856\"></use><use x=\"42.334208\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g10-0\" y=\"-35.247856\"></use><use x=\"47.396022\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g16-61\" y=\"-35.247856\"></use><use x=\"51.592377\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g10-157\" y=\"-35.247856\"></use><use x=\"54.937834\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g23-50\" y=\"-35.247856\"></use><use x=\"58.937837\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g10-186\" y=\"-35.247856\"></use><use x=\"63.344982\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g13-185\" y=\"-47.130527\"></use><use x=\"67.190552\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g19-48\" y=\"-47.130527\"></use><use x=\"73.631403\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g16-57\" y=\"-52.172593\"></use><use x=\"72.976863\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g16-71\" y=\"-45.26463\"></use><use x=\"77.176855\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g16-150\" y=\"-45.26463\"></use><use x=\"79.882308\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g16-72\" y=\"-45.26463\"></use><use x=\"84.402234\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g13-186\" y=\"-47.130527\"></use><use x=\"88.21791\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g23-50\" y=\"-51.245087\"></use><use x=\"92.352399\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g7-170\" y=\"-52.679709\"></use><use x=\"92.352399\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g7-174\" y=\"-46.702125\"></use><use x=\"92.352399\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g7-172\" y=\"-32.316071\"></use><use x=\"97.126441\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g10-0\" y=\"-64.258497\"></use><use x=\"102.333706\" xlink:href=\"#m001_g16-86\" y=\"-64.258497\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">手工特征占主导，深 CNN 计算昂贵且易饱和或过拟合</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Hand-crafted features dominated vision; deep CNNs were computationally prohibitive and prone to saturating gradients or severe overfitting.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">GPU 训练的深层卷积分类器，以 ReLU、dropout 和增强扩大可训练规模</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">End-to-end GPU-trained deep convolutional classifier scaling capacity via ReLU, dropout, and aggressive data augmentation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">5 个卷积层加 3 个全连接层，结合 GPU、ReLU、dropout 与数据增强</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">5 convolutional layers + 3 fully connected layers integrating multi-GPU execution, ReLU non-linearity, dropout, and crop/color augmentations.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">推动通用 CNN/ImageNet 表示迁移，后续被医学 2D 任务广泛采用</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Catalyzed transfer of generic ImageNet CNN representations across 2D medical imaging classification and detection.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">历史里程碑；不再是医学强基线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Historical milestone; superseded as a competitive medical backbone.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">局部卷积与权重共享把图像结构先验写入参数化方式。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">ReLU、GPU 并行和数据增强共同使大规模深监督训练成为现实。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">dropout 主要约束大容量全连接层，并不替代外部验证。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: End-to-end GPU-trained deep convolutional classifier scaling capacity via ReLU, dropout, and aggressive data augmentation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: 5 convolutional layers + 3 fully connected layers integrating multi-GPU execution, ReLU non-linearity, dropout, and crop/color augmentations.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Cross-Channel Local Response Normalization (LRN) in Original AlexNet.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可作为理解早期 ImageNet 到医学 2D 迁移的历史起点，但今天不应作为强主干。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">早期大步幅与多次下采样容易抹去微小病灶，医学使用应审计输入分辨率。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Catalyzed transfer of generic ImageNet CNN representations across 2D medical imaging classification and detection.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Historical milestone; superseded as a competitive medical backbone.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2012/hash/c399862d3b9d6b76c8436e924a68c45b-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>ImageNet Classification with Deep Convolutional Neural Networks</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<span class=\"spec-muted-val\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">未提供官方实现</span><span class=\"lang-en\">No Official Repository</span></span>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}